  "body": "> Let readStart be options[\"[at](https://fs.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-filesystemreadwriteoptions-at)\"], if given; otherwise [this](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this)'s [file position cursor](https://fs.spec.whatwg.org/#filesystemsyncaccesshandle-file-position-cursor).\r\n\r\nThe problem here is that it's always given. That's how Web IDL works.\r\n\r\nSo it should probably be optional https://github.com/whatwg/fs/pull/76#issuecomment-1370485096 as suggests, but the reason for that is that otherwise it's pretty much always 0, unless explicitly given with a different value.",
